title: EMR Connect › Manage › Open the Manage drawer
route: /emr
intro: One system's details in a right-hand drawer: connection facts, what the agents may read, the write-back switch, the field mappings and a Disconnect or Reconnect button.
dir: TD
also: Drawer buttons that the demo does not have: pause, edit, rename, delete, rotate sign-in. The only way to stop a system is Disconnect, and a system is never removed.
---
start s1 "Click 'Manage' on a row\nOr click 'Manage mapping' in the page header"
process p0 "Header button opens the outpatient site\nOr the first system if there is no outpatient site"
overlay o1 "Drawer: {system name}\n'{kind} · {what it holds}'\nStatus pill on the right, X at the top"

group gDet "Card: Connection details"
  process d1 "Type, Connected since, Contact at the practice\nLast sync: 'N min ago' or 'Not syncing'\nAccess: 'Secure, read-only connection'"
  toast d2 "The issue text, if there is one\nFor example the expired sign-in"
endgroup

group gPerm "Card: Permissions"
  process r1 "Read chips\nAssessments, Progress notes, Labs, Medications, Insurance card\nBilling system: Claims, Remittances, Payment dates"
  click w1 "Click the switch\n'Write back the approval number and dates, only after a person approves'"
  decision wq "Switch is now?"
  store w2 "Write-back on for this system"
  store w3 "Write-back off for this system"
  agent w4 "Navigator logs 'Write-back is on for {name}, approval number and dates only, after a person approves'\nOr 'Write-back is off for {name}'"
  toast w5 "'Write-back is on'\n'Only the approval number and dates, and only after a person approves.'\nOr 'Write-back is off': 'The agents only read from this system.'"
endgroup

group gMap "Card: Field mappings"
  process m1 "'{n} mapped, {m} waiting'\nTable: Their field, Fills, Mapped by"
  click m2 "Click 'Map' on a 'Not mapped' row"
endgroup

decision bq "Is the system Disconnected?"
click b1 "Click 'Disconnect'\nRed outline button"
click b2 "Click 'Reconnect'\nGreen button"
click cx "Click the X, press Escape, or click the dimmed area"
end e1 "Drawer closes\nBack on the page"
process n1 "The switch is saved but nothing else in the demo reads it\nThe Dashboard write-back approval opens whether it is on or off"
goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"
goto g2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Manage › Disconnect and reconnect"

s1 --> o1
s1 -.-> p0
p0 --> o1
o1 --> d1 & r1 & m1
d1 -.-> d2
r1 --> w1 --> wq
wq -->|On| w2
wq -->|Off| w3
w2 --> w4
w3 --> w4
w4 --> w5
w5 -.-> n1
m1 --> m2 --> g1
m1 --> bq
bq -->|No| b1 --> g2
bq -->|Yes| b2 --> g2
o1 -.-> cx --> e1
